---
import Typewriter from "./Typewriter.astro";
---

<section>
  <Typewriter
    ><h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold">&gt; experience</h2></Typewriter
  >
  <ul class="space-y-3 text-md">
    <li>
      <span class="font-semibold text-lg"
        >Junior Software Engineer, Deltologic, Poznań</span
      >
      <span class="text-muted text-lg"> — 2025</span>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Developed and delivered full-stack features for the DataDoe platform, a
        production application integrating AI with Amazon's e-commerce data.
        Built and maintained complex front-end solutions in React and
        TypeScript, and developed back-end services using NestJS integrated with
        the OpenAI API. Contributed to platform stability by reducing technical
        debt and delivering reliable and maintainable solutions across the
        stack. Actively contributed to high code quality through peer reviews
        and continuous knowledge sharing with senior developers.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="font-semibold text-lg"
        >Software Engineering Intern, Deltologic, Poznań</span
      >
      <span class="text-muted text-lg"> — 2025</span>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Contributed to front -end development of the DataDoe application,
        gaining hands-on experience with Git version control, GitHub workflows,
        and project management tools such as ClickUp. Gained exposure to AWS
        cloud infrastructure and production environments.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
